### arc_memo

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// Spiral values are Rc-based (not Send + Sync), and ArcMemo only has a SyncStorage constructor: the memo holds a\n// SendWrapper of the value (wasm is single-threaded), unwrapped by signal_get/signal_get_untracked.\nnominal arc_memo t = $'leptos::prelude::ArcMemo<leptos::__reexports::send_wrapper::SendWrapper<`t>>'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  // Spiral values are Rc-based (not Send + Sync), and ArcMemo only has a SyncStorage constructor: the memo holds a
  // SendWrapper of the value (wasm is single-threaded), unwrapped by signal_get/signal_get_untracked.
  nominal arc_memo t = $'leptos::prelude::ArcMemo<leptos::__reexports::send_wrapper::SendWrapper<`t>>'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

