### (~:>) fragment

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"instance (~:>) fragment = fun x =>\n    real\n        typecase t with\n        | array_base (view' (html_element ~el)) =>\n            inl x = a x\n            inl x = am.toList `a `int `(view' (html_element el)) x\n            inl x = listm.map `(view' (html_element el)) `view (element_to_view `el) x\n            view_list_to_fragment x\n        | list (view' (html_element ~el)) =>\n            inl x = listm.map `(view' (html_element el)) `view (element_to_view `el) x\n            view_list_to_fragment x\n        | list view =>\n            view_list_to_fragment x\n        | _ => x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  instance (~:>) fragment = fun x =>
      real
          typecase t with
          | array_base (view' (html_element ~el)) =>
              inl x = a x
              inl x = am.toList `a `int `(view' (html_element el)) x
              inl x = listm.map `(view' (html_element el)) `view (element_to_view `el) x
              view_list_to_fragment x
          | list (view' (html_element ~el)) =>
              inl x = listm.map `(view' (html_element el)) `view (element_to_view `el) x
              view_list_to_fragment x
          | list view =>
              view_list_to_fragment x
          | _ => x
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### (~:>) view

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"instance (~:>) view = fun x =>\n    real\n        typecase t with\n        | view' (html_element _) => element_to_view x\n        | _ => x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  instance (~:>) view = fun x =>
      real
          typecase t with
          | view' (html_element _) => element_to_view x
          | _ => x
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

