### typecheck_signal

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl typecheck_signal forall (t : * -> *) u. (signal : t u) : () =\n    real\n        typecase t with\n        | signal => ()\n        | arc_signal => ()\n        | rw_signal => ()\n        | arc_rw_signal => ()\n        | read_signal => ()\n        | arc_read_signal => ()\n        | write_signal => ()\n        | arc_write_signal => ()\n        | memo => ()\n        | arc_memo => ()\n        | _ => error_type `(()) (\"invalid signal\", ``(t u))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl typecheck_signal forall (t : * -> *) u. (signal : t u) : () =
      real
          typecase t with
          | signal => ()
          | arc_signal => ()
          | rw_signal => ()
          | arc_rw_signal => ()
          | read_signal => ()
          | arc_read_signal => ()
          | write_signal => ()
          | arc_write_signal => ()
          | memo => ()
          | arc_memo => ()
          | _ => error_type `(()) ("invalid signal", ``(t u))
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

