### arc_action_pending

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// ArcAction::pending is an ArcMemo of the plain value: read into an arc_memo (see arc_memo)\ninl arc_action_pending forall t u. (action : arc_action (heap t) u) : arc_memo bool =\n    inl pending : $'leptos::prelude::ArcMemo<bool>' = !\\\\(action, $'\"leptos::prelude::ArcAction::pending(&$0)\"')\n    new_arc_memo fun () => $'leptos::prelude::Get::get(&!pending)' : bool","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  // ArcAction::pending is an ArcMemo of the plain value: read into an arc_memo (see arc_memo)
  inl arc_action_pending forall t u. (action : arc_action (heap t) u) : arc_memo bool =
      inl pending : $'leptos::prelude::ArcMemo<bool>' = !\\(action, $'"leptos::prelude::ArcAction::pending(&$0)"')
