### arc_action_pending_fn

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// A reader of the action's pending state. arc_action_pending makes a new memo, and one made inside a reactive closure\n// is dropped when the closure returns (leptos subscribers hold their sources weakly), so that closure would never\n// re-run: the memo is made once, outside the reader.\ninl arc_action_pending_fn forall t u. (action : arc_action (heap t) u) : () -> bool =\n    inl pending = action |> arc_action_pending\n    fun () => pending |> signal_get","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  // A reader of the action's pending state. arc_action_pending makes a new memo, and one made inside a reactive closure
  // is dropped when the closure returns (leptos subscribers hold their sources weakly), so that closure would never
  // re-run: the memo is made once, outside the reader.
  inl arc_action_pending_fn forall t u. (action : arc_action (heap t) u) : () -> bool =
      inl pending = action |> arc_action_pending
      fun () => pending |> signal_get
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

