### attr_fn

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// A reactive attribute, property or class (`name={move || f()}`): leptos re-runs `fn` when a signal it reads changes.\n// Text values must be std::string::String (leptos has no attribute impls for Rc<str>).\ninl attr_fn forall t. (name : string) (fn : () -> t) : string =\n    inl fn = fn |> send_wrapper_new\n    $'\"\" + !name + \"={ move || (*!fn)() }\"'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  // A reactive attribute, property or class (`name={move || f()}`): leptos re-runs `fn` when a signal it reads changes.
  // Text values must be std::string::String (leptos has no attribute impls for Rc<str>).
  inl attr_fn forall t. (name : string) (fn : () -> t) : string =
      inl fn = fn |> send_wrapper_new
      $'"" + !name + "={ move || (*!fn)() }"'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

