### url_try_from

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// leptos_router 0.8 parses through the browser's URL (relative to the page's origin); the error is a JsValue\ninl url_try_from (s : rust.ref sm'.str) : resultm.result' url sm'.std_string =\n    !\\\\(s, $'\"<leptos_router::location::BrowserUrl as leptos_router::location::LocationProvider>::parse($0).map_err(|x| x.as_string().unwrap_or_default())\"')","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
